This package is a bundle. `dist/fcms.mjs` contains, compiled and inlined:

  @forinda-cms/render  the deterministic spec-to-HTML runtime  — AGPL-3.0-or-later
  @forinda-cms/spec    the spec model, validation and diff     — Apache-2.0
  @forinda-cms/lang    the YAML surface syntax and printer     — Apache-2.0
  @forinda-cms/sdk     the HTTP client for a forinda-cms server — Apache-2.0

The bundle as a whole is therefore AGPL-3.0-or-later: it contains the renderer,
which is part of the product rather than part of the interop surface. The three
Apache-2.0 packages remain available under Apache-2.0 on their own — the file
format and the client are meant to be copied, and nothing here restricts that.

Corresponding source for this bundle: https://github.com/forinda/forinda-cms

Third-party dependencies (commander, yaml, zod) are declared in package.json and
installed from npm under their own licences. They are not bundled here.
